IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ml-rules`

-- Independent tests: expected values from independent-expectations.md.

GIVEN ap IS A BOOLEAN
      edb IS A DATE
      conf IS A MAYBE DATE
      cont IS A MAYBE DATE
      res IS A MAYBE DATE
      q IS A DATE
      ua IS A BOOLEAN
      lw IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Maternity position`
`pos` ap edb conf cont res q ua lw MEANS
  `the maternity position for` (`Maternity case` OF ap, edb, conf, cont, res, q, ua, lw)

GIVEN conf IS A MAYBE DATE
      cont IS A MAYBE DATE
      res IS A MAYBE DATE
      q IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Maternity position`
`std` conf cont res q MEANS
  `pos` TRUE (Date 1 7 2024) conf cont res q FALSE FALSE

DECIDE base IS `std` (JUST (Date 1 7 2024)) NOTHING NOTHING (Date 1 1 2020)

-- 1
#ASSERT base's `the compulsory absence starts on` EQUALS JUST (Date 20 5 2024)
#ASSERT base's `the compulsory absence ends on` EQUALS JUST (Date 11 8 2024)
#ASSERT base's `my leave may last until` EQUALS JUST (Date 18 5 2025)
#ASSERT base's `paid absence starts on` EQUALS JUST (Date 20 5 2024)
#ASSERT base's `paid absence ends on` EQUALS JUST (Date 11 8 2024)
